What each part will do
student/ → Student interface
Students will be able to:

•	Login 
•	View dashboard 
•	Report problems 
•	Upload images 
•	View previous reports 
•	Track report status 
•	Receive notifications 
•	Use the AI assistant 

admin/ → Admin/residence management interface
Admins will be able to:

•	View all reports 
•	See urgent problems 
•	Assign reports 
•	Change report statuses 
•	View AI insights 
•	View analytics 
•	Monitor recurring problems 

models/ → Database structure
This is where we'll define things such as:

Student
Admin
Report
Department
Assignment
Notification
routes/ → What happens when users interact with the website.
templates/ → HTML pages.
static/ → CSS, JavaScript and images.
.env → Private configuration such as database credentials and eventually AI API credentials.
